Subject: [PATCH] generic-parallel: standalone models, tests of TDLS, behaviour
 variables and the StandardElastoViscoPlasticity brick

- generic-parallel interface for models: same backends and options as
  for behaviours, models executed by ModelIntegrator
- tests: standalone models, behaviour variables and external models,
  StandardElastoViscoPlasticity brick (kinematic hardening, Hill
  criterion, porous flows), TDLS linear system solver (tdls
  sub-directories, requires the mfront::linear_system_solver::tdls
  component declared if TFEL is built with TDLS)
- comparison script functions shared in compare-functions.sh
